+// 500 × 80 ÷ 30 = 1333 for a content_host (1.33 pkts/tick long-run, 50% of
+// its 80 u/s). Pure function of catalog data (deterministic; ODN-10).
+spawn_credit_accrue_milli :: proc(cat: ^Catalogs, type_idx: u16) -> u32 {
